profile:
The Vasmacska (in English: Ironcat) rock band was formed in the fall of 2009 in Túrkeve, Hungary.

Founding members:

Weiszné, Koós Ilona Mónika (Sicu) - Vocals;
Balog Anita (Ban) - Lead guitar;
Tóth Viktória (Vikki) - Bass guitar;
Kelemen Ágnes (Ági) - Drum.

Latest line-up:

Weiszné, Koós Ilona Mónika /Sicu - Vocals;
Máté Évi - Lead guitar;
Jutasi Szandra - Bass guitar;
Kelemen Ágnes /Ági - Drum.
